  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Return and Reintegration Programmes in Germany: Joint Networking Platform 2022</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to develop a coherent approach to assisted voluntary return and reintegration (AVRR) in Germany. It does so by increasing the capacity of return and reintegration counsellors and of other stakeholders to inform migrants in a comprehensive and coherent manner on the various AVRR interventions led by IOM, the Federal Ministry of the Interior, Building and Community (BMI) and the Federal Ministry for Economic Cooperation and Development (BMZ). The project proposes to return counsellors and other relevant stakeholders in Germany a series of networking events. These will constitute a platform to exchange information and practices and to learn about AVRR. A handbook capturing information on all AVRR initiatives in Germany will also be produced.</narrative>
  </description>
